OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fbrighter spells to the east initially,
OL,7,Fbut cloud soon returning and staying
OL,8,Fmostly cloudy overnight with a few
OL,9,Fspots of rain possible at times. Low
OL,10,Fcloud and hill fog likely over the
OL,11,Fmoors. Another warm and fairly humid
OL,12,Fnight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FLargely cloudy skies on Monday
OL,15,Fwith a few outbreaks of rain or
OL,16,Fdrizzle possible at times. Some warm
OL,17,Fand humid brighter spells also likely
OL,18,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
